{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":16,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 16:1"},"The preparations of the heart in man, and the answer of the tongue, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," from the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 16:2"},"All the ways of a man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," clean in his own eyes; but the LORD weigheth the spirits. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 16:3"},"Commit thy works unto the LORD, and thy thoughts shall be established. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 16:4"},"The LORD hath made all ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["things"]}," for himself: yea, even the wicked for the day of evil. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 16:5"},"Every one ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that is"]}," proud in heart ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," an abomination to the LORD: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["though"]}," hand ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["join"]}," in hand, he shall not be unpunished. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 16:6"},"By mercy and truth iniquity is purged: and by the fear of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," depart from evil. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 16:7"},"When a man’s ways please the LORD, he maketh even his enemies to be at peace with him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 16:8"},"Better ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a little with righteousness than great revenues without right. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 16:9"},"A man’s heart deviseth his way: but the LORD directeth his steps. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 16:10"},"A divine sentence ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the lips of the king: his mouth transgresseth not in judgment. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 16:11"},"A just weight and balance ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," the LORD’S: all the weights of the bag ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," his work. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 16:12"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," an abomination to kings to commit wickedness: for the throne is established by righteousness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 16:13"},"Righteous lips ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," the delight of kings; and they love him that speaketh right. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 16:14"},"The wrath of a king ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is as"]}," messengers of death: but a wise man will pacify it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 16:15"},"In the light of the king’s countenance ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," life; and his favour ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," as a cloud of the latter rain. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 16:16"},"How much better ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is it"]}," to get wisdom than gold! and to get understanding rather to be chosen than silver! ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 16:17"},"The highway of the upright ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," to depart from evil: he that keepeth his way preserveth his soul. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 16:18"},"Pride ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["goeth"]}," before destruction, and an haughty spirit before a fall. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 16:19"},"Better ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it is to be"]}," of an humble spirit with the lowly, than to divide the spoil with the proud. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 16:20"},"He that handleth a matter wisely shall find good: and whoso trusteth in the LORD, happy ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," he. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 16:21"},"The wise in heart shall be called prudent: and the sweetness of the lips increaseth learning. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 16:22"},"Understanding ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a wellspring of life unto him that hath it: but the instruction of fools ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," folly. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 16:23"},"The heart of the wise teacheth his mouth, and addeth learning to his lips. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 16:24"},"Pleasant words ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are as"]}," an honeycomb, sweet to the soul, and health to the bones. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 16:25"},"There is a way that seemeth right unto a man, but the end thereof ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," the ways of death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 16:26"},"He that laboureth laboureth for himself; for his mouth craveth it of him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 16:27"},"An ungodly man diggeth up evil: and in his lips ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is "]},"as a burning fire. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 16:28"},"A froward man soweth strife: and a whisperer separateth chief friends. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 16:29"},"A violent man enticeth his neighbour, and leadeth him into the way ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that is"]}," not good. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 16:30"},"He shutteth his eyes to devise froward things: moving his lips he bringeth evil to pass. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 16:31"},"The hoary head ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a crown of glory, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["if"]}," it be found in the way of righteousness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:31"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PRO 16:32"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["He that is"]}," slow to anger ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," better than the mighty; and he that ruleth his spirit than he that taketh a city. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:32"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"33","sid":"PRO 16:33"},"The lot is cast into the lap; but the whole disposing thereof ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," of the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 16:33"}]}]}
